cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  For the latest tagged release, cite the version and its release DOI when
  available. For an artifact on main that is not included in a tagged release,
  cite the specific commit and artifact path. For an artifact-specific release,
  use that artifact’s CITATION.cff and release tag.
title: "Research Artifact Ledger"
authors:
  - family-names: Davis
    given-names: Richard George
date-released: 2026-10-08
version: 0.2.0
url: https://github.com/RichardGeorgeDavis/research-artifact-ledger
abstract: >-
  A versioned repository for bounded research artifacts with explicit source
  trails, evidence labels, reproduction notes, limitations, and correction
  history. Version 0.2.0 contains a reproduced finite negative prime-ranking
  screen; it makes no general predictor or novelty claim. Current main contains
  additional untagged public artifacts. See the repository README for the
  current artifact index and each artifact record for its evidence scope,
  limitations and review status. These records do not claim peer review, broad
  verification, field-level novelty, or new empirical or physical results.
  Cite a commit when citing untagged content on main. The final author release
  of When a Perspective Grows has artifact-specific tag
  when-a-perspective-grows-v2.7; use its own citation metadata for the
  manuscript.
